{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1349713-miscellannea-of-spirits","id":1349713,"title":"Miscellannea of spirits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-19T16:17:12-08:00","id":1349713,"title":"Miscellannea of spirits","content":"Hi all<br /> <br /> I've written a load of plot to throw at my players and I'm putting together the various things that they might conceivably fight, influence or bother. I've got the resources from the quick character section of the main rulebook, but what I'm really after are lots and lots of example quick character (or even full sheets) templates for spirits, dragon blooded, etc. <br /> I've been creating my own but I'd like to see lots of example charms that I can pinch and rework, rather than come up with lots of new stuff from scratch. <br /> <br /> Is there any web resource, or are any of the other books outside the main book full of such goodies? Failing that, feel free to post any spirits, dragon blooded or demons you may have come up with below in this threat, I promise to steal all the ones that I like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4249-gribblethemunchkin","name":"gribblethemunchkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4249_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T16:26:14-08:00","id":1349718,"title":"","content":"Here's a bunch of demons.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/223770-homebrews-of-the-first-circle\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/223770-homebrews-of-the-first-circle\"> Homebrews of the First Circle? - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/223770-homebrews-of-the-first-circle\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/223770-homebrews-of-the-first-circle </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Something I was curious about. I've been looking, but I'm having trouble finding any Homebrew First Circles. I found two(both in a blog named Octipodial Preservation), but that's pretty much it for anything with stats. So, does anyone know where I can find some? Those which were on the Lost Wiki would be </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T16:27:56-08:00","id":1349720,"title":"","content":"The Storyteller's Vault (a store for player-created content) has you covered :<br /> <br /> -<a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7?src=by_author_of_product&amp;filters=0_45735_0_45643_0_0\" target=\"_blank\">The Book of Laughing Serpents</a> is a Series all about Demons. I especially recommend the latest entry (vol 7), but they're all good.<br /> <br /> -The Thousand Sanctioned Beasts is another Series with various types of NPCs. It just so happens to have 1 entry for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/273385/The-Thousand-Sanctioned-Beasts--Elementals?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=0_45735_0_45643_0_0\" target=\"_blank\">Elementals</a> (